<title>UK: DB Capital Markets sets warrants on the DAX index.</title>
<headline>DB Capital Markets sets warrants on the DAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets GmbH has issued 20 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on the DAX index, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE	    ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A    3,300.00 DEM    2.00 DEM	9.79 PCT    15.94 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B    3,400.00 DEM    1.57 DEM     11.57 PCT    20.31 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 18.FEB.97-13.MAR.98   PAYDATE	18.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
